      "jp": "ハロウィンの夜。僕はオプスカリテさんから誘われて、\nフェアリー娘さんたちの舞踏会へ訪れていた。",
      "jp_sha256": "6759f49b46fb816b77c49b3cfdb00d66c7cc0d0daef931d80c3b7edb9f5e744c",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "할로윈 밤. 나는 옵스카리테 씨의 초대를 받고\n페어리 아가씨들의 무도회를 찾아왔다.",
      "message_index_0based": 0,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 20,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b008-20261106-451bb6a2fb2c21c5",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "1b47318e2c971d3b3defb28eb8107ac3748ee8b2e259f955192bfbbd432b0ddc:000002_3715687328447001616:g0:r19",
      "row_index_0based": 19,
      "serialized_row_index": 19,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "ハロウィンの夜。僕はオプスカリテさんから誘われて、\nフェアリー娘さんたちの舞踏会へ訪れていた。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
